9,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"رَّبُّ ٱلۡمَشۡرِقِ وَٱلۡمَغۡرِبِ لَآ إِلَٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ فَٱتَّخِذۡهُ وَكِيلٗا","TajweedText":"رَّبُّ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَشْرِقِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَغْرِبِ ل<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هَ إِلَّا هُوَ فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّخِذْهُ وَكِيلاً <span class=end>٩</span>","End":"٩","PageNumber":574,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":508,"MaqraNumber":229,"HizbNumber":58,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":73,"SurahIndex":"073","VerseNumber":10,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَٱصۡبِرۡ عَلَىٰ مَا يَقُولُونَ وَٱهۡجُرۡهُمۡ هَجۡرٗا جَمِيلٗا","TajweedText":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>صْبِرْ عَلَىٰ مَا يَقُولُونَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>هْجُرْهُمْ هَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>رًا ج</tajweed>َمِيلاً <span class=end>١٠</span>","End":"١٠","PageNumber":574,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":508,"MaqraNumber":229,"HizbNumber":58,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":73,"SurahIndex":"073","VerseNumber":11,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَذَرۡنِي وَٱلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ أُوْلِي ٱلنَّعۡمَةِ وَمَهِّلۡهُمۡ قَلِيلًا","TajweedText":"وَذَرْنِى وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُكَذِّبِينَ أُ<tajweed class=slnt>وْ</tajweed>لِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َعْمَةِ وَمَهِّلْهُمْ قَلِيلاً <span class=end>١١</span>","End":"١١","PageNumber":574,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":508,"MaqraNumber":229,"HizbNumber":58,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":73,"SurahIndex":"073","VerseNumber":12,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّ لَدَيۡنَآ أَنكَالٗا وَجَحِيمٗا","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ لَدَيْن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed>